<h1>Reverse</h1>
<hr align="left" width="100.526%" size="5" class="whs3">
<p class="description"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Description:</b></span> Reverses normal/direction of datum entity.</p>
<p class="parameterstitle"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Parameters</b></span>:</p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span style="font-style:italic; font-weight:bold;"><i><b>Type</b></i></span> – type of the entity to which the entity belongs, which normal/direction will be reversed. See <u style="color:#ff0000;"><a href="../type_conventions.htm" style="color:#ff0000; font-size:10pt;">Type Conventions</a></u> for details. Available values are:</p>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span style="font-style:italic;"><i>Line</i></span> – line is reversed.</p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span style="font-style:italic;"><i>Plane</i></span> – plane normal is reversed.</p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span style="font-style:italic;"><i>Circle</i></span> – circle normal is reversed.</p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span style="font-style:italic;"><i>Cylinder</i></span> – cylinder axis is reversed.</p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span style="font-style:italic;"><i>Cone</i></span> – cone axis is reversed.</p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span style="font-style:italic;"><i>RectSlot</i></span> – rectangular slot normal is reversed.</p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span style="font-style:italic;"><i>RoundSlot</i></span> – round slot normal is reversed.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span style="font-style:italic; font-weight:bold;"><i><b>Name</b></i></span> – name of the entity, which radius will be modified.</p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span style="font-style:italic; font-weight:bold;"><i><b>ModifyWith</b></i></span> – <span lang="EN-GB">amount of increasing/decreasing of the radius.</span></p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span style="font-style:italic; font-weight:bold;"><i><b>ToCopy</b></i></span> – sets whether <span lang="EN-GB">to generate new entity with the modified radius or not. Available options are</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-style:italic;"><i>No</i></span> <span lang="EN-GB">or</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-style:italic;"><i>0</i></span> <span lang="EN-GB">(to modify the existing entity) and</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-style:italic;"><i>Yes</i></span> <span lang="EN-GB">or</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-style:italic;"><i>1</i></span> <span lang="EN-GB">(to create new entity).</span></p>
<p class="parameterstitle"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>UI Commands</b></span>:</p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span style="font-style:italic;"><i>Reverse</i></span> from the tree context menu for lines, planes, and circles.</p>
<p class="ExampleCode">Examples:</p>
<p class="ExampleCode">Reverse( Type="Circle", Name="Circle 1", ToCopy=0 )</p>
<p class="ExampleCode">Reverse( Type="Cone", Name="Cone 1", ToCopy=Yes )</p>
